{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>The silver of the atonements.</b> Since it is stated above concerning it 'to make atonement for your souls,' it calls it silver of the atonements. The pericicle of Ki Tissa is joined here because it wrote above 'once a year he shall make atonement upon it,' and the silver of the atonements likewise once a year; and afterward it mentions the laver and its base, and the anointing oil, and the incense of spices, and the vessels anointed with oil, and the great craftsmen, who are Bezalel and Oholiab, and the Sabbath — that no work shall be done on it, even the work of the Holy One, blessed be He; and the prayer of Moses before his descent from the mountain, and he needed to mention the matter of the calf first, to know what he prayed about. It also mentions his descent, and the burning of the calf, and his return to pray yet a second time on their behalf, and the anger of Moses when he brought his tent outside the camp of Israel, and the glory of Moses when he saw the great glory, and what the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded him to descend to hew out second tablets and to write the commandments a second time; and it mentions the conditions of the covenant he made with Israel, which are written in the pericicle of Mishpatim, and the radiance of his face when he descended from the mountain, and the tablets of the covenant in his hand." "<b>For the children of Israel for a remembrance.</b> Since it is given for the service of the tent of meeting, all the time that I remember the tabernacle I shall remember them." "<b>To make atonement for your souls.</b> One may say: all the time that the work was being done from this silver, it remained in force, and there is no need to give atonement a second time when they would be counted; therefore they did not give atonement when they were counted in the wilderness of Sinai. But in the days of David the work had already ceased, and therefore they were smitten."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:27.111623127Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}